4d4wlxMKukwGZDhGgsUhJEDZmywu2fFQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRvHmBksA3H4rtZybTp9ryQ0KHuCfcavBNZKuWSkvtZYQ&oe=6B0B321E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u6a2a\u7248\u5c01\u9762.png", "id": "1189218307009815", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624395_1189218310343148_2698386406489628834_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qkPAAwQQe24Q7kNvwEcRS77&_nc_oc=AdpO-hpLAHLGhDM3gsdaQpDNjwQp7q3bSPyFkdFhzxqRZoEX2rbJ1WjR4iolwFcF8K0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSomQzO3mUvWfyCu3V-NNqxX9P6clekJTguQpDZ2HO-5g&oe=6B0B0EFB"}, "display_name": "Return to 2000", "keywords": ["nostalgia", "childhood", "courtyard", "exploration"], "long_description": "Return to 2000 takes you to Rongyin New Village, a Chinese residential neighborhood at the turn of the millennium. Walk past tiled apartment blocks, follow the paths under the trees, and spend a little time with the things children found to do before dinner.\n\nThrow a paper airplane from the courtyard pavilion. Try hopscotch, flick marbles, or pick up a paddle at the table-tennis area. Walk down to the corner shop for an ice pop or soda. Inside apartment A101, slide the window, open a drawer, and look through a picture book.\n\nExplore at your own pace with teleportation, smooth movement, snap turning, and height settings. Watch the neighborhood change from a golden afternoon to rain, snow, or night.\n\nThis is a single-player VR experience played with tracked controllers. Menus, readable signs, the picture book, and the telephone message are in English.", "short_description": "Spend a summer afternoon in a Chinese neighborhood at the turn of the millennium. Fly a paper airplane, play hopscotch and marbles, and explore the corner shop and an old family apartment in a quiet, single-player VR experience.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "h